; Copy, Join, Sort, Search options (Phase 221)
FailAt 21
Delete work-copy ALL QUIET >NIL:
MakeDir work-copy
CD work-copy
Echo "one" >f1
MakeDir d1
MakeDir d1/d2
Echo "deep" >d1/d2/f3
MakeDir dst
Copy f1 dst
Type dst/f1
Copy f1 TO dst/renamed
Type dst/renamed
Copy f1 dst2
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Type dst2
Copy f1 newdir/
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Copy f1 TO f1
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Type f1
Copy f1 TO /work-copy/F1
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Type f1
Copy f1 TO ""
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Type f1
Copy f1 TO /work-copy
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Copy f1 TO /work-copy/
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Type f1
Copy d1 dst3
Echo "rc=$RC"
Copy d1 dst4 ALL
Echo "rc=$RC"
Type dst4/d2/f3
Copy d1 dst5 ALL QUIET
Echo "rc=$RC"
Copy f1 nosuchdir/x
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Copy nosuch x
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Copy f#? dst6
Echo "rc=$RC"
Filenote f1 "note"
Protect f1 +s
SetDate f1 02-Feb-22 10:11:12
Copy f1 TO plain
List plain NODATES
Copy f1 TO cloned CLONE
List cloned
Copy f1 TO dated DATES
List dated
Copy f1 TO commented COM
List commented NODATES
Copy f1 TO nopro NOPRO
List nopro NODATES
Echo "two" >f2
Join f1 f2 TO j1
Type j1
Join f1 nosuch TO j2
Echo "join rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Type j2
Join f1 f2 j3
Echo "join rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Join f1 AS j4
Type j4
Echo "zebra" >s1
Echo "Apple" >>s1
Echo "mango" >>s1
Echo "10" >>s1
Echo "9" >>s1
Sort s1 TO s2
Type s2
Sort s1 TO s3 CASE
Type s3
Echo "30" >n1
Echo "4" >>n1
Echo "100" >>n1
Echo "-2" >>n1
Sort n1 TO n2 NUMERIC
Type n2
Echo "x3 b" >c1
Echo "y1 c" >>c1
Echo "z2 a" >>c1
Sort c1 c2 COLSTART 4
Type c2
Sort nosuch TO s6
Echo "sort rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
Search f1 ONE
Echo "rc=$RC"
Search f1 o NONUM
Search f1 xyz
Echo "rc=$RC"
Search d1 deep ALL
Echo "rc=$RC"
Search f1 "o?e" PATTERN
Search f1 f1 FILE QUIET
Search nosuch x
Echo "rc=$RC r2=$Result2"
CD /
Delete work-copy ALL QUIET
Echo "done"
